# LF in the repo, always. The remote box is Linux and the tree is rsynced to it
# verbatim; a CRLF that slips in breaks the shell scripts there.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Profiler output and model weights — never diff, merge or eol-normalise.
*.ncu-rep binary
*.nsys-rep binary
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
